  "title": "Spicy Old Bay Skinny Fries",
  "description": "Potatoes are spiralized into these skinny fries and baked in a mixture of Old Bay seasoning and hot sauce then topped with malt vinegar.",
  "authors": [
    "lutzflcat"
  ],
